                <l xml:id="m-7ade5ea4-cd9d-48ca-ad31-aab306f171ee" facs="#m-337dbe67-4283-4155-a2d1-2573e2fd8037" label="text-like">Commemorations of the Sunday or of the Feria. 10s9</l><l xml:id="m-5a49c888-a1b1-43a5-b61b-6cebf4204141" facs="#m-994577e8-27cd-4030-b32c-d08f84afc13f" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-3e01d322-4976-4925-83a6-c14dc36db756" facs="#m-5b858bf1-69c8-4cfa-b46a-767638e9ae55" label="lyrics-like">A, quaésumus Dómine, nostris! nostrárum vegetatiónem tránseat</l><l xml:id="m-49bcbb8a-5a6a-4315-900d-811ac941f393" facs="#m-5033b764-f985-4938-b19b-61b9136599ef" label="lyrics-like">O efféctum jejúniis salutárem:</l><l xml:id="m-86a30861-2830-49fb-a540-dc72112c3d9e" facs="#m-29e2f56d-1c35-42cb-900a-1298837d5615" label="lyrics-like">animárum. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b82b8cbc-a26e-446e-a787-28dcc15bb747" facs="#m-9c481c41-7d0c-456d-b65d-072fd178b603" label="lyrics-like">ut castigátio carnis assúmpta, “ad</l><l xml:id="m-9b9fcbed-12ac-4ece-b65e-249ac1781c48" facs="#m-f8233a46-a802-4458-ac1a-413add185201" label="text-like">Third Week of Lent. Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-160f69f9-0385-49a9-aad1-fdc035d19f87" facs="#m-dace0106-2c48-4ddc-be15-19febbd3dcda" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-a4c7c0e4-913f-42f7-98a1-b0ac47316d3e" facs="#m-9b9902ca-a710-40d8-be25-04778c17cf3e" label="ambiguous">Ant. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-9c96635b-de65-418e-906a-6e71710ce2c7" facs="#m-273d15cf-d6ec-4759-96d8-77a03a2e3d2e" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-7d6b4033-43e1-4eab-a842-fa754e5882fd" facs="#m-dc773c84-6d34-441e-8403-e55acb502e7a" label="lyrics-like">UM fórtis armátus“ custódit átri-um sú-um,</l><l xml:id="m-eed62d95-1a0a-43c2-98ef-2ffc639104e4" facs="#m-9238f42e-8ae4-45ac-bd29-8862c424b1e5" label="lyrics-like">in pâce sunt ómni¬ a quae póssidet.</l><l xml:id="m-1ad8cc4a-52f3-4217-a596-0f39c93a5c74" facs="#m-169ad789-be84-4eee-9e6e-9418b72e0de6" label="ambiguous">Monday.</l><l xml:id="m-f0999095-419d-48e1-ad0c-88173d5f7779" facs="#m-6f8082e3-f55d-4160-82c1-ea521ec4c8be" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-7bf31937-c283-48b8-b289-8ca0a8e16b3c" facs="#m-4164c2cb-c5b9-43ea-bcda-ae037f922d28" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-00856f20-4ea7-4b6b-b1ce-5e00c17f89c5" facs="#m-5305a198-4808-4b9c-b58c-6308e704133d" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-56d73e6d-6879-4d26-a412-88000990b3f4" facs="#m-7c69c046-5ee2-41df-90b0-bff90bca6248" label="lyrics-like">-men díco vóbis, * qui-a némo prophéta</l><l xml:id="m-91f9ee81-6809-428f-b7bc-6171e4de3ae5" facs="#m-0edfce2a-e7e4-4de9-935a-13477ce509cc" label="ambiguous">ac¬</l><l xml:id="m-5f1890e1-135b-4714-b991-7fdeea083aa0" facs="#m-515a1796-8272-4e5c-a401-30f64f0f4d77" label="lyrics-like">céptus est in pátri-a sú¬a</l><l xml:id="m-afbc129e-72fc-4497-999c-9d056b059c4e" facs="#m-bc1170aa-5969-4423-b312-ba1416616b84" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-9c902749-89ae-4c6b-aaf4-f19f649ae2d4" facs="#m-eed93813-4551-4e4b-be6e-32e8e9c78a64" label="lyrics-like">(VOrdibus nostris, quaésumus Dó- libus abstinémus; * ita sensus quo¬</l><l xml:id="m-cbc9c0c6-fb71-441c-8f62-04e77e22fecd" facs="#m-bca0d4f0-a7f0-4407-b316-a4e231aa804e" label="lyrics-like">L mine, grátiam tuam benígnus</l><l xml:id="m-6941e6f9-45a0-44c4-9df1-f1479805669c" facs="#m-12a89e6c-2996-412a-b63b-654b506ce431" label="lyrics-like">que nostros a nóxiis retrahámus</l><l xml:id="m-5a0a96e5-6c0d-4223-855d-851242dae164" facs="#m-07699ca2-a24e-4fc1-9381-3ccb1976b509" label="lyrics-like">infúnde: f ut sicut ab escis carna-lexcéssibus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-53f189b1-9978-4323-ac98-988bb71cf84a" facs="#m-3324555a-e33a-44b6-b1fb-70994f1d699e" label="text-like">At Vesp.</l><l xml:id="m-80c9b0b7-7e11-4b70-b4d4-d1f47e2f1074" facs="#m-5cea267b-bc1e-4357-bcb9-f3301b5f9426" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-19735645-47c4-4251-a812-2f3b622ae812" facs="#m-ca25a1e9-391e-4c99-b50c-091c380b4980" label="ambiguous">d</l><l xml:id="m-27b85d58-54a1-444f-ac50-7ef113dccf96" facs="#m-66fb2ce4-ded5-4c40-8d56-70c76fcfcc59" label="lyrics-like">Esus autem tránsi-ens,</l><l xml:id="m-2fba5019-6ba5-478c-bc31-4066862b123e" facs="#m-e47e3ba4-3e93-4b00-a20e-8d0a363d730f" label="lyrics-like">per médi-um illórum</l><l xml:id="m-e9cba044-6d5a-49e7-ac6a-d4d3155a0545" facs="#m-187421be-81f9-4982-8392-e7960dfcff43" label="ambiguous">1-bat.</l><l xml:id="m-ba9d65b2-28dd-4215-87d7-54774ccecfb0" facs="#m-323a4cae-36e7-4a1b-bb1a-8a37d149ccd4" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-2f316fdf-8d4a-47e5-b320-c035d6a9c96d" facs="#m-21dcf9f5-f691-4edf-aedd-49102d8ac011" label="lyrics-like">CTUbvéniat nobis Dómine miseri-] lis te mereámur protegénte éripi, te</l><l xml:id="m-89d2f1ab-9abf-45d7-87b2-48fc52af7d89" facs="#m-1c6d7e7c-bee4-46aa-99f6-894d329b0b21" label="lyrics-like">córdia tua:*ut ab imminén-]liberante salvári. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-5e3adf4b-c343-4d30-9f8e-563c78c4741f" facs="#m-a4504e68-ad61-4f5a-9bdc-5967332aa110" label="lyrics-like">tibus peccatórum nostrórum pericu¬]</l></lg>
